type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T15:30:07Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T15:30:07Z","body":"> and adding it and extra check to tho ENTER_TREE should fix it\n\nOhhhhh. My simple patch did not do that. Perhaps it's getting confused because there's a check for `force_native` in `get_embedder` and it's selecting both embedded and native code branches.\n\nThat will probably fix the scale issue I suppose :D","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2970755736/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2970765206","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107491#issuecomment-2970765206","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107491","id":2970765206,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xEkeW","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T15:33:51Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T15:33:51Z","body":"> That will probably fix the scale issue I suppose\n\nNot sure if it will, it should have 0 effect on scale of this window, only on transforms of its child windows.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2970765206/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2970794722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107491#issuecomment-2970794722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107491","id":2970794722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xErri","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-13T15:45:11Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T15:45:11Z","body":"> and adding it and extra check to tho ENTER_TREE should fix it\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/scene/main/window.cpp b/scene/main/window.cpp\nindex 4dd24f8f3b..94b96a0208 100644\n--- a/scene/main/window.cpp\n+++ b/scene/main/window.cpp\n@@ -1370,7 +1370,7 @@ void Window::set_force_native(bool p_force_native) {\n                return;\n        }\n        force_native = p_force_native;\n-       if (!is_in_edited_scene_root() && get_tree()->get_root()->is_embedding_subwindows()) {\n+       if (!is_in_edited_scene_root() && get_tree() && get_tree()->get_root()->is_embedding_subwindows()) {\n                set_embedding_subwindows(force_native);\n        }\n }\n@@ -1502,6 +1502,9 @@ void Window::_notification(int p_what) {\n                                if (!ProjectSettings::get_singleton()->is_connected(\"settings_changed\", callable_mp(this, &Window::_settings_changed))) {\n                                        ProjectSettings::get_singleton()->connect(\"settings_changed\", callable_mp(this, &Window::_settings_changed));\n                                }\n+                       } else if (get_parent() && get_tree()->get_root()->is_embedding_subwindows()) {\n+                               // Non-main window and main window is embedding.\n+                               set_embedding_subwindows(force_native);\n                        }\n\n                        bool embedded = false;\n```\n\nI can't reproduce any scaling issues on Windows and macOS, so not sure what's going on (and how exactly this change can affect it).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2970794722/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2970860991","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107491#issuecomment-2970860991","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107491","id":2970860991,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xE72_","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"http